  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Quality Physical Rehabilitation and Social Integration Services for Conflict-affected People with Disabilities (PWDs) in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Enhanced safe access to physical rehabilitation services for PWDs, 2. Improved skills and quality of physical rehabilitation service providers for PWDs, 3. Empowered key stakeholders providing sustainable physical rehabilitation services for PWDs, 4. Strengthened resilience and recovery of PWDs through social integration support</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The physical rehabilitation needs of PWDs who have been affected by conflict and other situations of violence in Aden, Mukalla, Saada, Sanaa, and Taiz in Yemen are met by 2025.&#x25a3; &#xbaa9;&#xc801;&#xc5d0; &#xb9de;&#xb294; &#xc2e0;&#xccb4;&#xc7ac;&#xd65c;&#xae30;&#xad6c; &#xc0ac;&#xc6a9; &#xc7a5;&#xc560;&#xc778; &#xbe44;&#xc728; &#xc99d;&#xac00;
&#x25a3; &#xc2e0;&#xccb4;&#xc7ac;&#xd65c;&#xc13c;&#xd130; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xb9cc;&#xc871;&#xb3c4; &#xc99d;&#xac00;
&#x25a3; &#xcde8;&#xc57d;&#xacc4;&#xce35; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0; &#xb9c8;&#xc2a4;&#xd130;&#xd50c;&#xb79c; &#xc218;&#xb9bd; &#xac74;&#xc218; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;</narrative>
  </description>
